OL,3,GNEWSAWhy starling murmurations thrill  
OL,4,Abirdwatchers                           
OL,6,FBirdwatchers have described their joy  
OL,7,Fat seeing starling murmations as a     
OL,8,Fsurvey seeks to build a picture of     
OL,9,Ftheir numbers.                         
OL,11,FResearchers from the University of     
OL,12,FGloucester are updating a survey       
OL,13,Fconducted a decade ago which examined  
OL,14,Fthe behaviour of the birds to find out 
OL,15,Fwhat has changed.                      
OL,17,FMurmurations are lauded as one of      
OL,18,F"nature's winter wonders" as they      
OL,19,Finvolve masses of starlings swooping   
OL,20,Fand diving in a pattern before         
OL,21,Froosting.                              
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
