OL,3,GNEWSAWhy starling murmurations thrill  
OL,4,Abirdwatchers                           
OL,6,FEncouraging people to participate in   
OL,7,Fthe survey, Devon artist Mike Langman  
OL,8,Fsaid the dances were "just absolutely  
OL,9,Fstunning", while Cornwall photographer 
OL,10,FPeter Glaser described murmations as   
OL,11,F"hair-raising".                        
